    "API Key": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API Key"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API Key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API Key 与敏感请求头仅加密保存在本机 iOS 系统钥匙串（Keychain）中，开发者无法读取或收集你的任何对话与凭据。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API keys and sensitive headers are stored encrypted in the local iOS Keychain. The developer cannot read or collect your chats or credentials."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API Key 与敏感请求头仅加密保存在本机 iOS 系统钥匙串（Keychain）中，开发者无法读取或收集你的任何对话与凭据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API Key 与标记为敏感的请求头仅保存在本机 iOS 钥匙串（Keychain）中；对话、附件、请求记录与个人记忆保存在本机 SwiftData 数据库，支持导出不含密钥的 JSON 备份或使用 AES-256-GCM 密码加密的完整备份，并可随时单条删除、清空对话或移除服务商销毁对应凭据。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API keys and headers marked as sensitive are stored only in the local iOS Keychain. Chats, attachments, request records, and personal memories stay in the local SwiftData database, support keyless JSON export or AES-256-GCM password-encrypted full backup, and can be deleted individually, cleared per chat, or purged when removing a provider."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API Key 与标记为敏感的请求头仅保存在本机 iOS 钥匙串（Keychain）中；对话、附件、请求记录与个人记忆保存在本机 SwiftData 数据库，支持导出不含密钥的 JSON 备份或使用 AES-256-GCM 密码加密的完整备份，并可随时单条删除、清空对话或移除服务商销毁对应凭据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API Key 加密存储于 iOS 系统 Keychain，所有请求由手机直接发往你配置的 API 地址。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API keys are encrypted in the iOS Keychain, and every request goes straight from your device to the API you configured."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API Key 加密存储于 iOS 系统 Keychain，所有请求由手机直接发往你配置的 API 地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API Key 加密存储于 iOS 系统 Keychain，所有请求由本机直接发往你配置的 API 地址。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API keys are stored encrypted in the system Keychain, and all requests are sent directly from this device to your configured API endpoints."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API Key 加密存储于 iOS 系统 Keychain，所有请求由本机直接发往你配置的 API 地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
