    "仅向该模型发送一条极短测试请求，用于核对模型 ID 权限及首字响应延迟。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sends a minimal test prompt to this model to verify access and measure time to first token."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅向该模型发送一条极短测试请求，用于核对模型 ID 权限及首字响应延迟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅在你首次确认数据出境/第三方传输披露后，你主动发送的会话上下文、所选附件、已启用的个人记忆或联网搜索关键词才会从你的设备直接发送至你所配置的模型 API 地址（如 OpenAI、Anthropic、Google Gemini、DeepSeek、OpenRouter、Tavily 或局域网服务）。相关数据的留存与使用受对应服务商自身的隐私条款约束。你可随时在本页点击「撤回发送授权」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only after you confirm the third-party data disclosure will your active conversation context, selected attachments, enabled personal memories, or web search queries be sent directly from your device to the API endpoints you configured (such as OpenAI, Anthropic, Google Gemini, DeepSeek, OpenRouter, Tavily, or LAN services). Retention and use of sent data are governed by each provider's own privacy policy. You can revoke permission here at any time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅在你首次确认数据出境/第三方传输披露后，你主动发送的会话上下文、所选附件、已启用的个人记忆或联网搜索关键词才会从你的设备直接发送至你所配置的模型 API 地址（如 OpenAI、Anthropic、Google Gemini、DeepSeek、OpenRouter、Tavily 或局域网服务）。相关数据的留存与使用受对应服务商自身的隐私条款约束。你可随时在本页点击「撤回发送授权」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
