        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 streamGenerateContent 接口，原生支持多模态与思考链"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用与手工加密备份一致的单文件加密格式，并携带删除墓碑记录以防已删对话复活，预留跨平台数据互通。开启自动同步后，进入或离开「夜奔」超过间隔时会自动双向合并。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses the same single-file encrypted format as manual encrypted backups, carrying deletion tombstones so deleted items stay deleted and keeping cross-platform compatibility. When auto-sync is enabled, Fugue merges changes both ways on launch or background after the minimum interval."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用与手工加密备份一致的单文件加密格式，并携带删除墓碑记录以防已删对话复活，预留跨平台数据互通。开启自动同步后，进入或离开「夜奔」超过间隔时会自动双向合并。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
