        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "或粘贴含 URL / Key 的整段文本…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "所有 API 密钥、备用密钥与敏感自定义请求头均存储在受系统硬件级保护的 iOS Keychain 中；会话、知识库与用量账本保存在沙盒内 SwiftData 数据库。普通备份会自动剥离全部密钥与含私密凭据的端点；加密备份采用 Apple CryptoKit（PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 + AES-256-GCM）在本地完成加解密，密码仅由你本人掌握。删除对话、清空历史或移除服务商将同步清理对应本地记录与钥匙串凭据。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All API keys, rotation keys, and sensitive custom headers are stored in the hardware-backed iOS Keychain, while conversations, documents, and usage logs reside in the sandboxed SwiftData store. Standard backups strip all secrets and sensitive endpoints; encrypted backups use Apple CryptoKit (PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 + AES-256-GCM) locally with a password known only to you. Deleting chats, clearing history, or removing providers purges the corresponding local records and Keychain secrets."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有 API 密钥、备用密钥与敏感自定义请求头均存储在受系统硬件级保护的 iOS Keychain 中；会话、知识库与用量账本保存在沙盒内 SwiftData 数据库。普通备份会自动剥离全部密钥与含私密凭据的端点；加密备份采用 Apple CryptoKit（PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 + AES-256-GCM）在本地完成加解密，密码仅由你本人掌握。删除对话、清空历史或移除服务商将同步清理对应本地记录与钥匙串凭据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "所有密码均加密保存于 iOS 系统 Keychain，上传云端前使用 AES-GCM + PBKDF2 本地加密，服务器仅看到密文。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All passwords stay in iOS Keychain. Backups are encrypted locally with AES-GCM + PBKDF2 before upload so the server sees only ciphertext."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有密码均加密保存于 iOS 系统 Keychain，上传云端前使用 AES-GCM + PBKDF2 本地加密，服务器仅看到密文。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "所选模型未启用识图能力，请选择支持图片的模型。": {
