    "手动记录职业、技术栈或语言偏好，最多 %lld 条，每条 %lld 字。启用会话记忆后，这些内容会随请求发送给所选模型及备用服务商；可在发送前临时关闭。不会自动提取聊天内容。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Manually record your work, tech stack, or language preferences: up to %lld entries of %lld characters each. When memory is enabled for a chat, these entries are sent with requests to selected models and backup providers. You can skip them before sending. Nothing is extracted automatically from chats."
          }
