          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按请求开始时间归入本地日期。费用采用请求当时的单价，不合并不同币种；可在服务商的模型列表设置单价。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Requests are grouped by their start time in your local time zone. Costs use the price saved when each request started. Currencies are kept separate. Set prices in the provider’s model list."
