    "支持 @ 点名与成员互相点名抢麦，有话接话、没话潜水，自动碰撞 2～6 句后停下等你拍板。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Supports @mentions and peer handoffs — members chime in when relevant and pause after 2–6 turns for your input."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "支持 @ 点名与成员互相点名抢麦，有话接话、没话潜水，自动碰撞 2～6 句后停下等你拍板。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "支持 EPUB、TXT、Markdown 和 PDF（含扫描版离线文字识别）。可直接把文件拖到这里，或先体验本地示例书摘。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Supports EPUB, TXT, Markdown, and PDF (with on-device OCR for scans). Drag files here or try the local sample excerpt."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "支持 EPUB、TXT、Markdown 和 PDF（含扫描版离线文字识别）。可直接把文件拖到这里，或先体验本地示例书摘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "支持 EPUB、TXT、Markdown 和 PDF（含扫描版离线文字识别）。正文保存在本机，并随完整备份导出。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Supports EPUB, TXT, Markdown, and PDF (including offline OCR for scanned pages). Text stays on this device and is included in full backups."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "支持 EPUB、TXT、Markdown 和 PDF（含扫描版离线文字识别）。正文保存在本机，并随完整备份导出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "支持 EPUB、TXT、Markdown 和带文字的 PDF。正文保存在本机，也会随完整备份导出。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose an EPUB, TXT, Markdown, or text-based PDF. The text stays on this device and is included in full backups."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "支持 EPUB、TXT、Markdown 和带文字的 PDF。正文保存在本机，也会随完整备份导出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "支持 NewAPI / OneAPI / LiteLLM / vLLM 等任意兼容接口；URL 末尾加 # 可禁用自动补全 /v1": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Any compatible API such as NewAPI, OneAPI, LiteLLM or vLLM. End the URL with # to skip adding /v1 automatically"
