    "标准（1600px）可显著节省上传流量与视觉 Token 消耗；高清（2400px）适合密集小字与表格截图 OCR；原图（最高 4096px）尽可能保留原始像素细节。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Standard (1600px) saves upload bandwidth and vision tokens; HD (2400px) suits dense small print and table screenshots; Original (up to 4096px) preserves maximum pixel detail."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标准（1600px）可显著节省上传流量与视觉 Token 消耗；高清（2400px）适合密集小字与表格截图 OCR；原图（最高 4096px）尽可能保留原始像素细节。"
          }
        }
      }
