    "纯本机运行，支持中英多词分词与 BM25 相关性排序，可一次搜索全部对话正文、思考过程、附件名与书架文档，无需配置外部向量 API。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Runs entirely on-device with CJK and English multi-term tokenization and BM25 ranking across chat messages, reasoning, attachment names, and bookshelf documents — no external embedding API required."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "纯本机运行，支持中英多词分词与 BM25 相关性排序，可一次搜索全部对话正文、思考过程、附件名与书架文档，无需配置外部向量 API。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
