            "value": "When documents are bound, Single Chat, Arena Comparison, and Group Roundtable automatically retrieve relevant passages with exact section/page citations; when Tools are on, the model can also call search_documents directly."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "绑定参考资料后，单聊、Arena 并发对比与圆桌群聊会自动检索高相关原文片段并带精确章节/页码作答；开启「工具」时模型也可主动调用 search_documents 深入查阅。"
