    "雨停后，观察员沿溪向上走。桥下水位已经回落，东岸的石阶还湿着。\n\n她在记录里区分了亲眼看到的水痕和村民回忆的最高水位。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After the rain stopped, the observer walked upstream. The water below the bridge had receded, and the stone steps on the east bank were still wet.\n\nIn her notes, she distinguished the watermarks she had seen herself from the peak water level the villagers recalled."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "雨停后，观察员沿溪向上走。桥下水位已经回落，东岸的石阶还湿着。\n\n她在记录里区分了亲眼看到的水痕和村民回忆的最高水位。"
          }
        }
      }
